              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Colette Castro"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I needed 3 tablespoons of this spice for a Moroccan Stew I was making. I had all ingredients but the allspice, so I just added a little more cinnamon, cloves. Otherwise used the recipes proportions. Delicious! I will use it for grilled, broiled, baked or even simmered crock-pot meats.",
