              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! I made it to use in a vege stew. I left out the white pepper (didn’t have any) and added 1 tsp smoky paprika. I did not notice the cinnamon as overwhelming.",
