            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "denise"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I needed to ground down my cloves and coriander seeds in a pestle and mortar but it was worth the effort! Ive been looking for this mix of spices and didn’t know it was called RAS EL HANOUT Not sure how it’s pronounced but man do they work together. My favourite is pepping up carrots with this spice and placing them on a warm bed of hummus with pomegranate seeds. Mwah delicious 😋",
            "datePublished": "2025-12-17T18:05:52.051Z"
          },
